<p>Enhance your vision for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns, giving you vision of all targets in range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 15, 18, 22, 25,</acronym> even through walls. While the goggles are active you also spot flaws in your opponent's defenses, increasing your resistance penetration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%.</acronym></p><p>In addition, the goggles passively increase your stealth, invisibility and trap detection by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 17, 24, 30, 34.</acronym></p>